2. PRIVACY & DATA SOVEREIGNTY COMMITMENT
================================================================================
(a) ZERO BEHAVIORAL SURVEILLANCE: The Software is architected with strict client-side data sovereignty. KIVO does not track, log, record, harvest, sell, or monetize your URLs, search queries, cookies, browsing history, or downloads.
(b) LOCAL DATA RESIDENCY: Bookmarks, saved credentials, history cache, and browser configurations are stored exclusively on your local storage device.
(c) CLIENT-SIDE SHIELD: The KIVO ad-blocking and privacy shield engine executes filters locally on your hardware; visited URLs are never transmitted to external inspection servers.

